  {"type": "bullets", "title": "Rowlatt Act, 1919",
   "items": [
    "Official: ==**Anarchical and Revolutionary Crimes Act**==; popularly the **\"Black Act\"**",
    "Based on **Sedition (Rowlatt) Committee** of Justice **Sidney Rowlatt**",
    "Passed **10 March 1919**; extended **Defence of India Act (1915)** powers",
    "Detention without trial up to **two years**; **3-judge** in-camera panel, no appeal",
    "**Habeas corpus suspended**; press curbs",
    "==Repealed under **Lord Reading**== with **Press Act 1910**",
    "**Jinnah, Malaviya, Mazhar-ul-Haq** resigned from Imperial Legislative Council"
   ]},
  {"type": "timeline", "title": "1919 in dates",
